<title>USA: Payless Shoesource Jan same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Payless Shoesource Jan same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kansas 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $119.5     $121.1	-1.3	 +0.7</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $2,333.7   $2,302.3	+1.4	 +3.6</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is	 4 weeks ended	   Feb 1.</p>
<p>    Full company name is	     Payless ShoueSource Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 figures are for fiscal 1995. Including five weeks in January and 53 weeks for that year, year-ago five-week sales were $149.1 million and full-year sales were $2.33 billion on a 53-week basis.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
